-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party components
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This ROS 2 (Humble) package builds against, but does not bundle, the
following components; they must be provided by the build environment:

  - ROS 2 (rclcpp, sensor_msgs, std_msgs, vision_msgs, geometry_msgs, tf2,
    tf2_ros), Apache-2.0-licensed.
  - OpenCV (https://opencv.org/), Apache License 2.0, used for color format
    conversion and IMU calibration XML I/O.
  - MoveSense X95 SDK, Apache License 2.0, located via
    find_package(MoveSense_X95_SDK). It is a separate component and is NOT
    bundled with this package.
